{"id":"742319eca99c7bd5","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-terms.md","title":"Terms of the Book’s Two Arithmetic Languages","display":"df-smullyan-terms — Terms of the Book’s Two Arithmetic Languages","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-terms","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-terms"],"display":"df-smullyan-terms — Terms of the Book’s Two Arithmetic Languages","source":"第 II 章 pp. 14–15；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 31–32、57）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-terms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-terms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-terms — Terms of the Book’s Two Arithmetic Languages"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 14–15；第 IV 章 p. 40（PDF 31–32、57）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"647ecd31b33462bf\" href=\"?note=647ecd31b33462bf\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-alphabet\">92-df-smullyan-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"647ecd31b33462bf\" href=\"?note=647ecd31b33462bf\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-alphabet\">92-df-smullyan-alphabet</a>；串的并置表示连接。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr T=\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathscr T=\\Sigma_E^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；以下运算是造串运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}terms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)&amp;\\coloneqq t\\mathtt{&#39;},&amp;\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}s f_j^E t\\mathtt{)}\\quad(1\\leq j\\leq3),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathscr T\\mid\n\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)\\in U,\n\\ \\forall j\\in J\\;\\forall s,t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Term}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}terms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)&amp;\\coloneqq t\\mathtt{&#39;},&amp;\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}s f_j^E t\\mathtt{)}\\quad(1\\leq j\\leq3),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathscr T\\mid\n\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\forall t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)\\in U,\n\\ \\forall j\\in J\\;\\forall s,t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_E&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&amp;\n\\mathrm{Term}_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,2\\}\">\\(\\{1,2\\}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{1,2,3\\}\">\\(\\{1,2,3\\}\\)</span>。候选族非空（包含全部有限串），故最小闭包存在；各构造增加串长度，通常的项树结构递归适用。</p>\n<p>后文把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{E,1}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,2}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,3}(s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,1}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,2}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,3}(s,t)\\)</span> 分别显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s+t),(s\\cdot t),(s\\mathsf E t)\">\\((s+t),(s\\cdot t),(s\\mathsf E t)\\)</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)\">\\(\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t&#39;\">\\(t&#39;\\)</span>。这些仍是原书的字符串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_3^E\">\\(f_3^E\\)</span> 是指数函数名串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf E\">\\(\\mathsf E\\)</span> 是显示缩写。数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_n^E\">\\(\\nu_n^E\\)</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个 accent 表示，不采用本地 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n(0)\">\\(S^n(0)\\)</span> 的串。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"647ecd31b33462bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"647ecd31b33462bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E$ 见 [[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]；串的并置表示连接。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_E,v_i^E,f_j^E,\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr T=\\Sigma_E^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}terms}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)&\\coloneqq t\\mathtt{'},&\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)&\\coloneqq\\mathtt{(}s f_j^E t\\mathtt{)}\\quad(1\\leq j\\leq3),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{U\\subseteq\\mathscr T\\mid\n\\{v_i^E:i\\geq1\\}\\cup\\{\\nu_n^E:n\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\subseteq U,\\\\\n&\\hspace{35mm}\\forall t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)\\in U,\n\\ \\forall j\\in J\\;\\forall s,t\\in U\\;\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t)\\in U\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Term}_E&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2,3\\}},&\n\\mathrm{Term}_A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Term}_{E,\\{1,2\\}}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{1,2,3\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{E,1}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,2}(s,t),\\operatorname{bin}_{E,3}(s,t)","display":false},{"tex":"(s+t),(s\\cdot t),(s\\mathsf E t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{succ}_E(t)","display":false},{"tex":"t'","display":false},{"tex":"f_3^E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf E","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_n^E","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"S^n(0)","display":false}],"bytes":1842,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 $\\mathcal L_E$ 的字符表、13 进位编码、包裹实例与对角码由[[92-df-smullyan-alphabet]]至[[92-df-smullyan-binary-wrapper]]另行记载。它们给出原书的编码机制；此前修订已在 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]、[[92-df-smullyan-formulas]]、[[92-df-smullyan-pe-pa-systems]]、[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]] 独立补齐原书语法、公理和编码，保留旧 G 支线。没有构造两种字符呈现之间的完整证明翻译，也没有提供机器核验。"},{"id":"40c0018b6d45300e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_{E,J}$ 与原书造项运算见 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]。"},{"id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本文 0、S、+、乘法为独立 token。原书后继是尾 accent，函数名是 f 加下标划线串，且 L_E 含指数；见 [[92-df-smullyan-terms]]。这里保留 G 的独立文法。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书语法与公理：[[92-df-smullyan-terms]] → [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] → [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]] → [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]] → [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-terms]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-185","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-terms]]"}],"outgoing":["647ecd31b33462bf"]}